\**{c=red:Note:}** Make sure you've checked the **Door to the Great Hall** and received the final cutscene for 5-2 in {z:Chateau d'Oraguille}.
* You must zone after this cutscene in order to proceed with the mission.

=2 Walkthrough
Trade enough {p:Crystals} to the {p:Conquest NPC} to raise your Rank bar and unlock the Mission, then accept it from the {n:Gate Guard}.
* Head to {z:Chateau d'Oraguille} and speak with {p:Halver}.
* Select the **Great Hall** door for a cutscene.
** Make sure to get the cutscene where the {n:King|Destin} asks you to retrieve a **Dreamrose**.
* Speak with {p:Halver} again.
* Go to (G-7) in {z:Western Altepa Desert}. The **Dreamrose** is butted up against Revelation Rock, in the southern section of the oasis (look for the body of water on your map).
** The {p:Unity Warp} (Level 125) will bring you close.
** Alternatively, you could use the {p:Survival Guide}.
* Check the **Dreamrose** to spawn {m:Sabotender Enamorado}.
** If you're low level, it is recommended that you bring enough people, pets and/or {p:Trusts|Trust} to reduce the damage done by {s:1000 Needles}. It is possible to do it with less, but spreading the damage out will help any HP concerns.
* Check the **Dreamrose** after defeating the NM to receive the {@k} {k:Dreamrose}.
* Return to {p:Halver}.
* Go toward the **Garden** at (F-8) for another cutscene. At the end of the cutscene, you'll receive the {@k} {k:Piece of paper}.

